[WeaponEnergyBlade]
localizedName=Energieklinge
infoString=Short-range melee weapon which uses energy each time it is fired.

[WeaponSpinfusor]
localizedName=SPINFUSOR
infoString=Single-shot, direct-fire projectile weapon. Projectile explodes on impact.

[WeaponChaingun]
localizedName=CHAINGUN
infoString=Rapid-fire projectile weapon.  Overheats if fired for too long.

[WeaponBlaster]
localizedName=BLASTER
infoString=Close-range energy weapon that fires multiple bolts. Projectiles bounce off surfaces.

[WeaponGrenadeLauncher]
localizedName=GREN. LAUNCHER
infoString=Single-shot parabolic projectile weapon that fires explosive grenades.

[WeaponRocketPod]
localizedName=ROCKET POD
infoString=Multi-shot weapon that fires a pod of 6 rockets. Rockets can be guided once fired.

[WeaponBurner]
localizedName=BURNER
infoString=Energy weapon that fires a ball of plasma. Projectile explodes on impact, setting fire to a small area.

[WeaponGrappler]
localizedName=GRAPPLER
infoString="Single-shot device designed to increase mobility. Fires a cable that attaches to targets. "

[WeaponSniperRifle]
localizedName=SNIPER RIFLE
infoString=Long-range weapon that uses energy and ammunition. Does more damage when more energy is used.

[WeaponBuckler]
localizedName=BUCKLER
infoString=Defensive weapon that acts as a forward facing shield when equipped. Projectile can be guided once fired.

[WeaponMortar]
localizedName=MORTAR
infoString=Single-shot, long range, parabolic projectile weapon that fires explosive shells.

[PackEnergy]
localizedName=ENERGY PACK
infoString=Passive effect increases the user's energy recharge rate.  Active effect provides the user with a sudden boost of acceleration.

[PackShield]
localizedName=SHIELD PACK
infoString=Passive effect slightly reduces damage to the user.  Active effect greatly reduces damage.

[PackRepair]
localizedName=REPAIR PACK
infoString=Passive effect slowly heals the user.  Active effect quickly repairs allies and objects within range.

[PackSpeed]
localizedName=SPEED PACK
infoString=Passive effect increases the user's running speed.  Active effect decreases the reload time of equipped weapons.

[WeaponHandGrenade]
localizedName=Hand Grenade
infoString=Individually thrown grenade with a timed fuse. Throw can be charged to increase range.

[ArmorLight]
infoString=Provides high mobility but little protection from damage.  Only armour that can use the Sniper Rifle.

[ArmorHeavy]
armorName=Heavy
infoString=Provides limited mobility but high protection from damage. Only armour that can use the Mortar.

[ArmorMedium]
armorName=Mittel
infoString=Provides medium mobility and protection from damage. Only armour that can use the Buckler.

[ConsumableHealth]
infoString=Replaces part of the users health up to their maximum capacity

[ConsumableHealthMP]
localizedName=Health Kit

[JetpackPickup]
localizedName=Jet Pack
infoString=Provides the user with the ablity to fly for short distances.

